{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}Sitemap · {{ web.title }}{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
<h1>Sitemap</h1>
<pre>/                       index.html    status of the latest run, per-node matrix, recent runs
├── history.html                      run × check table, last {{ web.history_runs }} runs
├── api.html                          routes and JSON schema
├── about.html                        checks, dependencies, configuration, access
├── sitemap.html                      this page
├── status.json                       latest run (machine-readable)
└── history.json                      run history (machine-readable)</pre>
<p>Served from <code>{{ web.dir }}</code> by httpd on the controller, to loopback clients{{ ' and the cluster nodes (' ~ web.cluster_url ~ ')' if web.cluster_url }}. Every file is regenerated by <code>mc1-healthcheck run</code>; <code>mc1-healthcheck render</code> rebuilds the HTML from the saved state without running checks.</p>
<ul>
  <li><a href="index.html">Status</a></li>
  <li><a href="history.html">History</a></li>
  <li><a href="api.html">API</a></li>
  <li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
  <li><a href="status.json">status.json</a> · <a href="history.json">history.json</a></li>
</ul>
{% endblock %}
